  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Trapped by Furuya, Toshi sneaks into the office at night looking for Kuroki's master tape, where Kawada confronts him, spots needle marks on his arm, and pleads with him not to destroy everything they built.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "マスターテープならないぞ。俺が持ち帰った。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ちょっと待て。いいから動くなって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "痛えな、離せ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "保釈金の分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "金なんかいらねえよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "じゃあ手切れ金と思って受け取れ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "今武井に狙われたら全部終わるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "裏ビデオのことも薬のことも、バレたら逃げきれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "俺ら、やっとここまで来たんだろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木君も巻き添えになるんだぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんな女なんて関係ねえんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やめろ！川田さん！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "マスターテープならないぞ。俺が持ち帰った。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The master tapes aren't here. I took them home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ちょっと待て。いいから動くなって。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait a second. Hold still and show me your arm.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "痛えな、離せ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ow, let go of me!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "保釈金の分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is your half of the bail money back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "金なんかいらねえよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't want your money.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "じゃあ手切れ金と思って受け取れ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then take it as severance pay and walk away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "今武井に狙われたら全部終わるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If detective Takei targets us right now, everything is finished.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "裏ビデオのことも薬のことも、バレたら逃げきれない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Underground tapes and drugs—if that comes out, there is no escape.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "俺ら、やっとここまで来たんだろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We finally fought our way this far!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木君も巻き添えになるんだぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will drag Kuroki down with us too!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんな女なんて関係ねえんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't care one bit about that girl!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やめろ！川田さん！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop it! Mr. Kawada!'",
      "gap": 0.65
